The plate is square, roughly 26 cm across in the image (about 460 px). The pizza pieces cover about 245 px by 105 px, which is roughly 14 cm by 6 cm. That is two or three small rectangular pieces of cheese pizza, about 1.5 cm thick.

Volume is about 14 × 6 × 1.5 ≈ 126 cm³. Pizza is fairly airy, around 0.6 g/cm³ at this thickness, so the total is about 75–100 g. I'll use 90 g.

